# Keep the build context small and the layer cache honest.
#
# build/ is the big one: shipping a host build tree into the context both
# slows every build and risks the builder picking up objects compiled
# against the host's headers rather than the image's.

build/
deps/*/build/
compose-data/
.git/
.gitignore
.containerignore
*.o
*.a
*.so
compile_commands.json
core
core.*
vgcore.*
tags
TAGS
